# Townhall

> Townhall is a leading source for conservative news, political cartoons, breaking stories, election analysis, and commentary on politics and the media culture — an information hub for conservatives, republicans, libertarians, and liberty-loving Americans.

To find articles on a topic, open `https://townhall.com/search/q?q={keywords}`. Optional parameters: `date` (`-7`, `-30`, `-90`, or a year such as `2026`), `sort` (`weighted`, `date`, or `relevance`), `authorId`, `pageIndex` (starts at 0), and `pageSize` (default 25). Results are HTML.

## Main Sections
- [News](https://townhall.com/news): Breaking political news and rapid reporting
- [Columnists](https://townhall.com/columnists): Opinion and analysis from Townhall's conservative columnists
- [Political Cartoons](https://townhall.com/political-cartoons): Editorial cartoons on politics and current events
- [Videos](https://townhall.com/watch): Video reporting, interviews, and commentary
- [Podcasts](https://townhall.com/podcasts): Townhall's podcast programs
- [Townhall VIP](https://townhall.com/vip): Premium subscriber content and analysis. Requires a subscription.

## Feeds & Sitemaps
- [Recent posts](https://townhall.com/feed): RSS of recently published posts
- [Trending](https://townhall.com/feed/trending): RSS of currently popular posts
- [News Sitemap](https://townhall.com/news-sitemap.xml): Recently published articles (Google News format)
- [Sitemap Index](https://townhall.com/sitemaps/sitemapindex-townhall.xml): Full index of site URLs
